        "name": "Druva - Successful Administrator Login After Multiple Failures",
        "description": "Detect an administrator successfully authenticating shortly after several failed login attempts. This can indicate:\n\u2022\tPassword spraying\n\u2022\tBrute-force attacks\n\u2022\tCredential stuffing\n\u2022\tSuccessful account compromise",
